# Clerk at the station — ticket handoff (Roadmap Phase 11B, intents in 15).
# NPC tag 2 = station clerk. The ticket arrives via a dialogue effect;
# the quest layer observes possession through its COLLECT objective.
# Response intents: 1=request-ticket (CORRECT), 2=smalltalk (PARTIAL),
# 3=offtopic (INCORRECT, the clerk asks again).

